I'm not sure which key Johnny sings it in. He had recorded this song on the
album Blood, Sweat, and Tears: and on the first volume of Unearthed(Who's Gonna
Cry). I think the unearthed version is in E. But I put the chords in F because,
that's the way Jimmie Rodgers sings it. But for easy chording, the key of G is
good.
